// const 5 <s dyn(-1) -> 0. Exercises the swapped dispatch: a const LHS routes
// SLT to the SGT helper (5 <s x  <=>  x >s 5; dyn(-1) >s 5 is false).
// SLT pops top as LHS, so make the dynamic RHS first, then PUSH 5 on top.
PUSH32 0xffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffff
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x00
MLOAD
PUSH1 0x05
SLT
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x20
PUSH1 0x00
RETURN
